-- Relink jobs to the ArcSite projects they were sent to.
--
-- Sending a job created the ArcSite project first and saved its id on the job
-- in a second step. When that second step was lost the project stayed in
-- ArcSite, the job had no id, so Pull Drawing never appeared and every later
-- send failed with "Project name ... already exists" (JB01712 was the one that
-- surfaced it). The app now adopts the existing project on that error; this
-- puts back the links that were already lost.
--
-- Pairs are ArcSite's own job number for each project, read from the ArcSite
-- API on 2026-11-18. Numbers with more than one project (JB00861) are
-- left out — the app picks between those itself when the job is next sent or
-- pulled. Only jobs with no project yet are touched, and only where exactly
-- one job carries the number and no job already holds that project.

